          "comment": "# Comfy Z-Image Turbo\n\nGenerate an image on Comfy Cloud with the official Z-Image Turbo template. Requires COMFY_API_KEY and model availability on Comfy Cloud.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete Z-Image Turbo graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its generated image.\n\n**Try this:** Change text on CLIP Text Encode (Prompt) and run again to compare results. Edit the visible nodes to change settings.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/benchmarks/image_z_image_turbo.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
